      "note": [
        "The occupational statistics do not include individuals employed in any of the Nordic countries. ",
        "From 2023 the age-group 16-69 years is reported and for previous years 16-64 years. From 2023, model-imputed occupations are included. Comparison of statistics for 2023 with previous years should therefore be made with caution. \r\n  Statistics for reference year 2022 are based on the population by Labour market status (BAS) instead of, as in previous years, on Labour statistics based on administrative sources (RAMS). Comparison of statistics for 2022 against previous years should therefore be done with caution. This table has been supplemented with two comparison years back in time based on BAS.",
